// The LEXER section below is shared with self_lex.tk (keep in sync until merge).
// GENERATED blocks (token kinds + keyword table + AST kind consts) are produced
// by gen_tklex.py (into self_lex.tk) and gen_tkast.py; see build note at oil
// Assembly: cat parse1.tk tkast_gen.tk kw_gen.tk parse2.tk parse3.tk > self_parse.tk

